The **Arbus** theme is an Instagram-inspired grid theme that displays posts in a multi-column layout, perfect for image-heavy newsletters. It's named after photographer [Diane Arbus](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diane_Arbus).

- [Live preview](https://demo.buttondown.com/cat-photographer/archive/)
- [Source CSS](https://github.com/buttondown/themes/blob/main/themes/arbus/assets/styles.css)

You can switch to the Arbus theme—and tweak any of the settings below, including the number of columns in the grid—from your [archive settings](https://buttondown.com/settings/archives).

